@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/actuator

// liveness (생존)  : 살아 있냐?                  -> DOWN 관리자(쿠버네티스) 서버를 재시작
// readiness (준비) : 요청을 받을 수 있냐?         -> DOWN 관리자(로드벨런서) 이서버로 요청을 보내지 않음 (재시작 안함)

// readiness에 db

### 1. [DB 켜짐] 전체 상태
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. [DB 켜짐] liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/liveness
Accept: application/json

### 3. [DB 켜짐] readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/readiness
Accept: application/json

### 4. [DB 꺼짐] 전체 상태
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 5. [DB 꺼짐] liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/liveness
Accept: application/json

### 6. [DB 꺼짐] readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/readiness
Accept: application/json

### 7. [DB 다시 켜짐] readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/readiness
Accept: application/json
